ct`\n- tsconfig paths enabled\n\n**Testing pattern** (from `/src/app/account/page.test.tsx` and `/src/app/auth/callback/route.test.ts`):\n- Uses `vi.mock()` to mock Supabase clients and Next.js modules\n- Example mocks: `@/lib/supabase/server`, `@/lib/account/snapshot`, `next/navigation` (redirect)\n- SSR server components tested by rendering JSX and checking DOM via `@testing-library/react`\n- Async route handlers tested with `NextRequest` + `vi.fn()` to verify side effects\n\n### 6. package.json Dependencies\n**Already installed**:\n- `@supabase/ssr@^0.10.2` ✓\n- `@supabase/supabase-js@^2.104.1` ✓\n- `next@^16.2.4` (BREAKING CHANGES per AGENTS.md — read `/node_modules/next/dist/docs/`)\n- `react@19.2.4`, `react-dom@19.2.4`\n- `zod@^4.3.6` (for schema validation)\n\n**NOT installed**:\n- `stripe@latest` — **will need to add**\n- `@stripe/stripe-js` — **will need to add**\n\n**Dev tools present**: vitest, testing-library, playwright (e2e), eslint, typescript\n\n### 7. Database Schema\n**Tables referenced** (from `/src/lib/account/snapshot.ts` lines 53-73):\n- `entitlements_v` — view returning `{ user_id, plan }`\n- `subscriptions` — table with `{ user_id, status, current_period_end, cancel_at, price_id }`\n- `profiles` — table with `{ user_id, email }`\n- `pro_trials` — table with `{ user_id, started_at, expires_at }`\n\nTypes defined in `snapshot.ts`:\n```typescript\ntype Plan = \"free\" | \"trial\" | \"pro\"\ntype SubscriptionStatus = \"active\" | \"canceled\" | \"incomplete\" | \"incomplete_expired\" | \"past_due\" | \"trialing\" | \"unpaid\" | \"paused\"\ntype Subscription = { user_id, status, current_period_end, cancel_at, price_id }\n```\n\n**NOTE**: No `customers` or `checkout_sessions` table visible yet — you'll need to design/create schema for Stripe integration.\n\n### 8. Environment Variables\n**Direct access pattern** (no typed wrapper currently):\n- `process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` (public, lines referenced in multiple files)\n- `process.env.NEXT_