{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ALZFx3SNW5VJchVasJyZUm","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: runtime\ndescription: API reference for the runtime route segment config option.\n---\n\nThe `runtime` option allows you to select the JavaScript runtime used for rendering your route.\n\n```tsx filename=\"layout.tsx | page.tsx | route.ts\" switcher\nexport const runtime = 'nodejs'\n// 'nodejs' | 'edge'\n```\n\n```js filename=\"layout.js | page.js | route.js\" switcher\nexport const runtime = 'nodejs'\n// 'nodejs' | 'edge'\n```\n\n- **`'nodejs'`** (default)\n- **`'edge'`**\n\n> **Good to know**:\n>\n> - Using `runtime: 'edge'` is **not supported** for Cache Components.\n> - This option cannot be used in [Proxy](/docs/app/api-reference/file-conventions/proxy).","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b359056d-8171-4758-80a4-d865a9a6082e","uuid":"58ed8936-a82d-40ab-a9ca-493747457757","timestamp":"2026-04-26T22:30:09.051Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: runtime\ndescription: API reference for the runtime route segment config option.\n---\n\nThe `runtime` option allows you to select the JavaScript runtime used for rendering your route.\n\n```tsx filename=\"layout.tsx | page.tsx | route.ts\" switcher\nexport const runtime = 'nodejs'\n// 'nodejs' | 'edge'\n```\n\n```js filename=\"layout.js | page.js | route.js\" switcher\nexport const runtime = 'nodejs'\n// 'nodejs' | 'edge'\n```\n\n- **`'nodejs'`** (default)\n- **`'edge'`**\n\n> **Good to know**:\n>\n> - Using `runtime: 'edge'` is **not supported** for Cache Components.\n> - This option cannot be used in [Proxy](/docs/app/api-reference/file-conventions/proxy).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
