{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Qv1f33CCDpoua3GyyfxGKw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HEdTaYTH5JQwA1mEuQ3uRV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nRALPH: A.17 Stripe Checkout tracer (closes #17)\n\nWire end-to-end Stripe Checkout for issue #17 (PRD #3). A signed-in Free\nuser can now click \"Upgrade to Pro — Monthly\" or \"Upgrade to Pro —\nYearly\" on /account, land on Stripe-hosted Checkout, and be redirected\nto /account?welcome=1 on success. DB writes from the resulting events\nland in #18 (webhook).\n\nKey decisions:\n- src/lib/stripe/client.ts lazily instantiates the SDK with\n  apiVersion \"2024-12-18.acacia\" (cast required because stripe-node v22\n  pins the apiVersion type to its bundled version).\n- getOrCreateCustomer takes (supabase, userId, email) — no auth\n  side-effects — and upserts a stub subscriptions row with status\n  'incomplete' on first creation.\n- createCheckoutSession builds success/cancel URLs from the request\n  origin and sets client_reference_id to the Supabase user id, so the\n  upcoming webhook can map the Stripe customer back to our user.\n- /api/checkout/create runs on Node runtime, validates the body with\n  zod ('monthly' | 'yearly'), and resolves to STRIPE_PRICE_MONTHLY /\n  STRIPE_PRICE_YEARLY env vars at call time. 401 / 400 / 500 surfaces\n  are explicit JSON errors.\n- /account renders a client UpgradeButtons component for Free users\n  (POST → fetch → window.location), shows a welcome banner when\n  ?welcome=1, and keeps Manage subscription as a disabled placeholder\n  until #19.\n- Vitest stub for the `server-only` import added under test/ via a\n  resolve.alias entry so unit tests can import server-tagged modules.\n\nFiles changed:\n- package.json, package-lock.json (add stripe, @stripe/stripe-js)\n- src/lib/stripe/{client,customer,checkout}.ts\n- src/lib/stripe/{customer,checkout}.test.ts\n- src/app/api/checkout/create/{route,route.test}.ts\n- src/app/account/{page,page.test,upgrade-buttons}.tsx\n- vitest.config.mts, test/server-only.ts\n\nBlockers for next iteration: none — #18 (webhook) is unblocked next.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":527,"cache_read_input_tokens":112249,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":527},"output_tokens":58,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b359056d-8171-4758-80a4-d865a9a6082e","uuid":"49a14d5c-4c6f-447c-b79c-25f3673adc78"}
